/* 既定ランタイムテーマの部品を暗色へ塗り替える（Mantineのテーマ相当を自前で持つ層） */
/* Repaints default runtime theme controls dark (our own Mantine-theme equivalent) */

.poc-root .unity-button {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-color: #4a515c;
    background-color: #353b45;
    color: #e6e8eb;
    transition-property: background-color, border-color, scale;
    transition-duration: 0.12s;
}

.poc-root .unity-button:hover {
    background-color: #424955;
    border-color: #f2a640;
}

.poc-root .unity-button:active {
    scale: 0.96 0.96;
    background-color: #2b3038;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-field {
    margin: 0;
    color: #e6e8eb;
    align-items: center;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-field__label {
    color: #9aa3ad;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0 6px 0 0;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

/* 既定テーマでは入力部の高さが0になり、トラックがラベルの上へずれるため明示する */
/* The default theme leaves the slider input at zero height, shifting the track above the label */
.poc-root .unity-base-slider--horizontal .unity-base-slider__input {
    height: 20px;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-slider--horizontal .unity-base-slider__drag-container {
    flex-grow: 1;
    height: 20px;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-popup-field__input,
.poc-root .unity-base-text-field__input {
    border-width: 1px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-color: #4a515c;
    background-color: #1f2329;
    color: #e6e8eb;
    padding: 4px 8px;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-popup-field__input:hover,
.poc-root .unity-base-text-field__input:hover {
    border-color: #6b7380;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-text-field:focus .unity-base-text-field__input {
    border-color: #f2a640;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-popup-field__arrow {
    -unity-background-image-tint-color: #9aa3ad;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-slider__tracker {
    top: 50%;
    height: 4px;
    margin-top: -2px;
    border-width: 0;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background-color: #4a515c;
}

.poc-root .unity-base-slider__dragger {
    top: 50%;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-top: -7px;
    border-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    border-color: #1b1d22;
    background-color: #f2a640;
}

.poc-root .unity-toggle__checkmark {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border-color: #4a515c;
    background-color: #1f2329;
    -unity-background-image-tint-color: #f2a640;
}

.poc-root .unity-scroller--vertical {
    width: 8px;
    border-width: 0;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
}

.poc-root .unity-scroller__low-button,
.poc-root .unity-scroller__high-button {
    display: none;
}

.poc-root .unity-scroller .unity-base-slider__tracker {
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 8px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

.poc-root .unity-scroller .unity-base-slider__dragger {
    width: 8px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0;
    left: 0;
    border-width: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: #4a515c;
}

/* ドロップダウンのポップアップ（パネル直下へ出る） / dropdown popup (spawned at panel root) */
.unity-base-dropdown__container-outer {
    background-color: #262a31;
    border-color: #4a515c;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

.unity-base-dropdown__item {
    color: #e6e8eb;
}

.unity-base-dropdown__item:hover {
    background-color: #3a414c;
}
